// swag type overrides.
//
// sqlc-generated params and models embed pgx driver types. With
// --parseDependency swag resolves them structurally, which is wrong for the
// wire format: these types implement MarshalJSON/UnmarshalJSON and travel as
// plain JSON scalars. Verified against pgx v5 — a Timestamptz marshals to
// "2026-09-02T12:00:00Z" and unmarshalling an object fails outright.
//
// Without these replacements the generated client types an ISO string field as
// a struct, so the frontend cannot assign to it without breaking the request.
replace github.com/jackc/pgx/v5/pgtype.Timestamptz string
replace github.com/jackc/pgx/v5/pgtype.Timestamp string
replace github.com/jackc/pgx/v5/pgtype.UUID string
